  "summary": {
    "derivative_id": "der:rc4:cb_e26f2d8882614c9cbcf906a11734c7e1:summary",
    "text": "Geelong & District Day Nursery Incorporated is a local early\u2011childhood service based in Geelong, Victoria. It operates a day nursery / children\u2019s centre, providing on\u2011site care and early childhood education for children in the Geelong & district area. Regulatory registration and the organisation\u2019s website and annual information statement identify the organisation, its role as a children\u2019s centre and its location; financial filings are available for the 2022\u201323 reporting year. CauseBase has evidence that the organisation runs a day nursery in Geelong but does not have sufficient descriptive evidence in this release to identify specific service models, age ranges served, opening hours or eligibility criteria."
  },
